        "original_id": "0eddb691-eda3-5f8c-ac7a-adcb5de12498",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Films: Jack Reacher, One Shot, The Libertine, Pride & Prejudice\n- People: Christopher McQuarrie, Lee Child, Tom Cruise, Rosamund Pike, David Oyelowo, Richard Jenkins, Jai Courtney, Werner Herzog, Robert Duvall\n- Awards: BIFA Award for Best Supporting Actress\n- Characters: Jane Bennet\n\nFacts:\n- In 2004, Rosamund Pike won the BIFA Award for Best Supporting Actress for The Libertine.\n- In 2005, Rosamund Pike portrayed Jane Bennet in Pride & Prejudice.\n- In 2005, Lee Child published the novel One Shot, which later served as the basis for Jack Reacher.\n- In 2012, Jack Reacher was released as an American action thriller film.\n- Jack Reacher was formerly called One Shot and was also known as Jack Reacher: One Shot.\n- Christopher McQuarrie wrote and directed Jack Reacher.\n- Tom Cruise starred as the title character in Jack Reacher.\n- Rosamund Pike, David Oyelowo, Richard Jenkins, Jai Courtney, Werner Herzog, and Robert Duvall also starred in Jack Reacher.",
